    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span aptos=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposal to cover up the existing etching would result in a material change that would affect the external appearance of the host building and is therefore considered to fall under the definition of development as set out under section 55 of the Town and Country Planning act 1990(as amended). Furthermore, the proposal does not benefit from permitted development as prescribed within Schedule 2, Part 1 of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) Order (England) Order 2015 (as amended). The proposal would therefore require planning permission.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
